OL,3,GNEWSALottie Brooks success makes author
OL,4,A'grateful'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe best-selling author of the popular
OL,7,FLottie Brooks series of children's
OL,8,Fbooks says writing them has been "lots
OL,9,Fof fun to do".
OL,11,FKatie Kirby, from Hove, has sold three
OL,12,Fmillion copies in five years.
OL,14,FThe tenth in the series, Lottie
OL,15,FBrooks's Twelve Disasters of Christmas,
OL,16,Fhas just been released.
OL,18,FKirby, who illustrates the books
OL,19,Fherself, said: "I feel really grateful
OL,20,Fthat so many people love to read about
OL,21,FLottie's life and I get to write it for
OL,22,Fmy job."
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
